/* Special exhibit "scroll_hanging_pole" (溪山 · 画叉挂轴).
   A small side view of a hall wall in the panel: three nails at different heights, a low table with the rolled 立轴 on it, and a
   visitor holding a 画叉 (a long bamboo pole with a forked iron tip). The visitor steers the fork tip (drag on the scene with a mouse or
   pen; on touch screens drag the 竿柄 pad under it; or W A S D / ↑ ↓). The person walks, raises the arm, leans the pole; the pole has
   length and weight: the wrist holds it like a stiff spring, the tip lags behind quick moves and sways, and it sags when loaded.
   1 hook the scroll's cord on the table with the fork; the rolled scroll then dangles under the tip as a pendulum (and makes the pole heavier);
   2 bring the fork just above a nail and lower it gently: the cord drops onto the nail ("嗒"). Too fast, off-centre, the pole leaning too
     far or the scroll swinging too wildly → the cord slides off the fork and the scroll falls (to the table or the floor; it is put back).
     Coming up under a nail slightly off-centre, a prong knocks the nail (画叉碰钉) and the tip is pushed aside;
   3 let go (release the drag / pad, Enter, or 松手): the scroll unrolls downward by itself — mount top first, then the peak, down to the
     foot — the roller snaps the silk taut with a wooden knock, the scroll sways on its nail a few times and settles; the 惊燕 flutter.
   The higher the nail, the higher the painting's lower edge above the floor, and the visitor under it tilts the head back further (悬画宜高).
   After a first hang the visitor can go close to the foot of the mountain and search the thicket behind the pack train for the hidden
   "范宽" signature with a loupe: on the hung work (wide screens, overlay aligned to api.artRect()) or in a detail view in the panel.
   The signature position was checked (P 9314,16965 in main-crop pixels; news-report circle + the museum's own account: lower right, among
   the trees behind the travellers). Only a circle is drawn; the characters are never retraced. The hung original is never altered.
   Text: room.special.{hint,hints.*,labels.*,results.*,find.*} with fallbacks. Sound: engine only (api.sfx; recorded xsh-* if present). */
